                                                "sense_id": "d6ceb54f-7817-3434-b815-5b037d5a8ec8",
                                                "text": "Joseph Wright, his predecessor in the chair, called him ‘a firstrate Scholar and a kind of man who will easily make friends’ at Oxford (quoted, sic, in E.M. Wright, The Life of Joseph Wright (1932), p. 483)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f8d8374-57f8-4ee6-8e53-8d0ade3e2a6a",
                                                "sense_id": "d6ceb54f-7817-3434-b815-5b037d5a8ec8",
                                                "text": "Jim’s Interests: General: Working out, hanging out at the local bars, expanding my mind, eating Tuna Sandwhiches...or so I’m told and poker... Television: ... this show that’s on Thuresday nights at 8 :30pm... I can’t place the name of it but it has this crazy interview style thing...[all sic]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b997f6ae-7c17-4f6e-b821-bdde8dd81290",
                                                "sense_id": "d6ceb54f-7817-3434-b815-5b037d5a8ec8",
                                                "text": "whole bussiness: Quoted sic in George F. Willison, Saints and Strangers (New York: Reynal and Hitchcock, 1945)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "11da7713-beee-469a-9eb2-912040ab9ed3",
                                                "sense_id": "d6ceb54f-7817-3434-b815-5b037d5a8ec8",
                                                "text": "In the posting, Matthews said he wished that, “more blacks [sic] people would look into ancient beliefs of pre Christian Africa.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
