                                                "sense_id": "f0188d2e-3743-371b-8231-42e1a86b7400",
                                                "text": "In the past few months, we in Upstate N.Y. have been subjected to fire bombings, firings, verbal and physical harassment, etc. The list goes on and on. These (sic) Christians are calling for a million marchers and may very well get that many."
